# Fixture checkpoints are large binaries (~126 MB each for fcn_resnet50) and are
# reproduced deterministically by:
#     python tools/rq5_fixture_gate_demo.py
# Their SHA-256 is recorded in RQ5_FIXTURE_GATE_DEMO.json under
# artifacts_sha256.checkpoint, so a reviewer can verify a re-run without the
# blobs living in the repository.
*.pt

# The fixture datasets themselves are regenerated by the same tool.
fixture_demo/**/*.png